# Shared evidence rule draft

SYNTHETIC_TRAINING_ONLY

When reporting an investigation:

- cite the material that supports each conclusion;
- state the repository, branch/ref, and revision used;
- separate verified facts, participant proposals, unknowns, and blocked checks;
- do not convert missing access or missing evidence into a pass;
- name the owner of future updates and restoration before sharing a revision.

This is an inactive training draft, not root `AGENTS.md`, organization Instructions, a ruleset, or an access-control policy.
